{"4714490": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Sausage Escape", "steam_appid": 4714490, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "dlc": [4851570, 4969520], "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>PLAY WITH FRIENDS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4714490/extras/550d9cef49b236217d16f2b27d0f856e.poster.avif?t=1788287981\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4714490/extras/550d9cef49b236217d16f2b27d0f856e.webm?t=1788287981\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4714490/extras/550d9cef49b236217d16f2b27d0f856e.mp4?t=1788287981\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong> </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You were just a sausage. You lay there quietly, not bothering anyone... until suddenly<strong>you regained consciousness</strong>. Now you have mobility, unusual abilities, and one important goal: cause real sausage mayhem without becoming someone's dinner.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4714490/extras/e9eeba8b89c3dc74817650dbebcbe35a.poster.avif?t=1788287981\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4714490/extras/e9eeba8b89c3dc74817650dbebcbe35a.webm?t=1788287981\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4714490/extras/e9eeba8b89c3dc74817650dbebcbe35a.mp4?t=1788287981\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use abilities, weapons, and other mechanics to get to places a normal sausage shouldn't be able to reach.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SURVIVE AND RUIN THE HUMAN'S LIFE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4714490/extras/187796ff0b6191ee5917c7123e317cb3.poster.avif?t=1788287981\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4714490/extras/187796ff0b6191ee5917c7123e317cb3.webm?t=1788287981\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4714490/extras/187796ff0b6191ee5917c7123e317cb3.mp4?t=1788287981\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The house owner, rats, and other inhabitants</strong> aren't about to sit back and watch a sentient sausage scurry around the house causing chaos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Evade your pursuers, hide, run, and use the environment to your advantage. Break the washing machine, interfere with the normal life of the house, and complete crazy tasks.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>RUN, SAUSAGE, RUN!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4714490/extras/f853b6cbfca8c089e7b99e845f6ddda6.poster.avif?t=1788287981\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4714490/extras/f853b6cbfca8c089e7b99e845f6ddda6.webm?t=1788287981\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4714490/extras/f853b6cbfca8c089e7b99e845f6ddda6.mp4?t=1788287981\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Roll around the house, explore rooms, climb into unexpected places, and find new ways to interact with the environment.</strong>The washing machine can become a trap. Furniture is an obstacle course. An ordinary person is a formidable opponent.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And what's on the table might turn out to be a weapon. Explore this strange world, discover new possibilities, and discover the true capabilities of a sausage that's suddenly tired of being eaten.</p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>PLAY WITH FRIENDS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4714490/extras/550d9cef49b236217d16f2b27d0f856e.poster.avif?t=1788287981\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4714490/extras/550d9cef49b236217d16f2b27d0f856e.webm?t=1788287981\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4714490/extras/550d9cef49b236217d16f2b27d0f856e.mp4?t=1788287981\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong> </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You were just a sausage. You lay there quietly, not bothering anyone... until suddenly<strong>you regained consciousness</strong>. Now you have mobility, unusual abilities, and one important goal: cause real sausage mayhem without becoming someone's dinner.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4714490/extras/e9eeba8b89c3dc74817650dbebcbe35a.poster.avif?t=1788287981\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4714490/extras/e9eeba8b89c3dc74817650dbebcbe35a.webm?t=1788287981\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4714490/extras/e9eeba8b89c3dc74817650dbebcbe35a.mp4?t=1788287981\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use abilities, weapons, and other mechanics to get to places a normal sausage shouldn't be able to reach.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SURVIVE AND RUIN THE HUMAN'S LIFE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4714490/extras/187796ff0b6191ee5917c7123e317cb3.poster.avif?t=1788287981\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4714490/extras/187796ff0b6191ee5917c7123e317cb3.webm?t=1788287981\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4714490/extras/187796ff0b6191ee5917c7123e317cb3.mp4?t=1788287981\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The house owner, rats, and other inhabitants</strong> aren't about to sit back and watch a sentient sausage scurry around the house causing chaos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Evade your pursuers, hide, run, and use the environment to your advantage. Break the washing machine, interfere with the normal life of the house, and complete crazy tasks.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>RUN, SAUSAGE, RUN!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4714490/extras/f853b6cbfca8c089e7b99e845f6ddda6.poster.avif?t=1788287981\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4714490/extras/f853b6cbfca8c089e7b99e845f6ddda6.webm?t=1788287981\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4714490/extras/f853b6cbfca8c089e7b99e845f6ddda6.mp4?t=1788287981\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Roll around the house, explore rooms, climb into unexpected places, and find new ways to interact with the environment.</strong>The washing machine can become a trap. Furniture is an obstacle course. An ordinary person is a formidable opponent.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And what's on the table might turn out to be a weapon. Explore this strange world, discover new possibilities, and discover the true capabilities of a sausage that's suddenly tired of being eaten.</p>", "short_description": "This is a co-op adventure about sausage survival, where any mistake will turn you into mincemeat. Play solo or with a group of sausage fighters. Survive in a dangerous house, completing missions and using teleporters, flamethrowers, and custom guns in different modes.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French, German, Spanish - Spain, Traditional Chinese, Portuguese - Brazil, Russian, Turkish, Italian, Arabic, Bulgarian, Czech, Danish, Dutch, Finnish, Greek, Hungarian, Indonesian, Japanese, Korean, Malay, Norwegian, Polish, Portuguese - Portugal, Romanian, Simplified Chinese, Spanish - Latin America, Swedish, Thai, Ukrainian, Vietnamese<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4714490/2cc5104574625ae4c1bdf07d39f3b47184cd0f57/header.jpg?t=1788287981", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4714490/51a93a7950ccc3be8e8cda888e1db49ad7a3ef84/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1788287981", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4714490/51a93a7950ccc3be8e8cda888e1db49ad7a3ef84/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1788287981", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb